## V8 gate-fix session: merge with manus-parity, all gates green
H3 complete: deterministic correction detector («لا، قلت لك…» style cues) for the
Harness2 correction-learning workstream. Committed as `f40f2d9`.

## What shipped
- `src/learning/harness/correctionDetector.ts` (new, H3, BUILD_SPEC §6.3):
  `detectCorrection({ priorAssistant, userText }) -> { isCorrection, score, matched }`.
  Deterministic first stage of flow A (§9): no model call, no network, no state, no I/O.
  - `EN_PATTERNS` (one regex): `no|nope|wrong|incorrect|that's not|not what i (asked|meant|
    wanted)|i said|i told you|don't|stop|instead|should (be|have)|again,? `, word-bounded.
  - `AR_PATTERNS` (one regex, MSA + Gulf): `لا[،,\s]|غلط|خطأ|مو كذا|مب كذا|مو هذا|قلت لك|
    قلتلك|لا ت|ليش سويت|المفروض|بدال|بدل ما|مرة ثانية|ترا |ترى `.
  - Score: 0.6 base when any cue matches, +0.1 when the message is shorter than 400 chars,
    +0.2 when it opens with a negation (`^(لا|no)\b`), capped at 1; `isCorrection` at
    score >= `CORRECTION_THRESHOLD` (0.6, exported).
  - Returns score 0 and `matched: []` when there is no prior assistant turn or the message
    is blank (a correction must correct something).
- `src/learning/harness/__tests__/correctionDetector.test.ts` (new, 21 tests, 5 suites):
  the required Arabic + English fixtures plus negatives and the score contract.

## Acceptance criteria (H3 plan row / Verify column)
- ≥ 8 Arabic+English fixtures, all passing:
  `لا، قلت لك اكتب اسم نتريو بالعربي «نتريو» مو Nutrio` -> true,
  `لا، مو كذا` -> true, `هذا غلط` -> true, `المفروض تكتب الاسم بالعربي` -> true,
  `بدال ما تكتب بالانجليزي` -> true, `مرة ثانية، لا تضف العلامة التجارية` -> true,
  `ليش سويت كذا؟` -> true, `no, that's not what I asked for` -> true,
  `wrong, try again` -> true, `I told you to keep it short` -> true,
  `instead, use the Arabic name` -> true.
- "thanks, perfect" -> false (score 0.1, under the 0.6 threshold).
- no prior assistant (null / whitespace) -> false, score 0.
- Blank user message -> false.
- `node --import tsx --test src/learning/harness/__tests__/correctionDetector.test.ts`
  -> tests 21, pass 21, fail 0.
- Whole harness suite `src/learning/harness/__tests__/*.test.ts` -> tests 38, pass 38.

## Two findings from running the tests (spec behaviour, tests corrected not code weakened)
1. §6.3 reports **one cue per pattern** (`t.match(p)` takes the first match of that
   pattern), so `matched` for `لا، قلت لك ...` holds only the opening `لا،` and not
   `قلت لك`. The first draft asserted `قلت لك` would be listed; the assertion was
   corrected to the documented behaviour (pattern-order first match).
2. A short neutral message still collects the +0.1 short-message bonus, so `thanks,
   perfect` scores 0.1, not 0. The assertion now checks `score < CORRECTION_THRESHOLD`
   instead of `score === 0`. Neither change touched production code.

## Gates (all run from the worktree root)
- `npx tsc --noEmit`                                 -> exit 0
- `npm run build:server`                             -> exit 0 (dist/server.cjs 19.3mb, pdf worker copied)
- `(cd packages/web && npx next build)`              -> exit 0 (compiled successfully, 25/25 static pages)
- `npm run check:encoding`                           -> OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid)
- `node --import tsx --test src/learning/harness/__tests__/*.test.ts` -> tests 38, pass 38, fail 0

## Rules honoured
- Only `src/learning/harness/{correctionDetector.ts,__tests__/correctionDetector.test.ts}`
  were added; `.h2-ref/`, `.jtask.md` and every other file were left alone
  (`git show --stat f40f2d9` = 2 files).
- Arabic was written with the file-edit tool only. No shell redirect produced file content.
  No literal mojibake placeholder was added anywhere in the tree.
- No existing implementation was duplicated: `git grep -i "detectCorrection|isCorrection"`
  over `src`/`packages` returned nothing, so this module is the first detector. Storage
  (H2 `experienceStore.recordCorrection`), distillation (H4) and wiring (H8) are separate.
- No agent/system instruction is created, changed or proposed by this task; nothing here
  can alter agent instructions, so no pending proposal was required.
- No test was weakened, deleted or skipped. No secrets committed. Nothing pushed.

Test command:
  node --import tsx --test src/learning/harness/__tests__/correctionDetector.test.ts

