   `.jdone` conflicted. It is a prepend/append rollup and both stages share the
   previous base as a suffix, so the resolution is a pure union of the two report
   blocks; only the nine conflict-marker lines were removed.

After every merge, no parity file was dropped: all 4726 files at the final parity
tip are present in the merged index. `git rev-list --left-right --count
manus-parity...HEAD` is `0 13`.

