## N9 deliverables (unchanged by this session)

Structured clarification that pauses a run and resumes with the answers attached as
context, plus the auto-trigger the planner's low-confidence flag feeds:

- `src/tools/askUserTools.ts` — the `ask_user` agent tool (questions with options,
  `allowFile` upload flag, free-text fallback).
- `src/tools/askUserStore.ts` — durable pending-request records with a TTL,
  `waitForAskUser` that clears the record on abort so a cancelled card cannot leave
  the task's mutating tools blocked for the rest of the window.
