  `askUserRequested` / `askUserResolved` event pair and the `resolve_ask_user`
  client message, carried over the socket bridge
  (`src/protocol/__tests__/askUserSocket.test.ts`).
- `src/graph/runGraph.ts` — the ask node on the run graph, mirroring
  `approval_required`.
- `packages/web/src/components/approval/AskUserCard.tsx` — the right-panel card
  (auto-opens when the event arrives, user can edit or continue from chat),
  Arabic/RTL via `dir="auto"` and `packages/web/src/i18n/{en,ar}.json`.
- Registration: `src/index.ts`, `src/setup/runtime.ts`, `src/modes/catalog.ts`
  (`ask_user` in the mode-catalog CONTROL set), `prompts/loam-master.md` and
  `src/agent/masterPromptText.ts` (regenerated).

