Independent end-to-end probe (no stubs, real production objects)
---------------------------------------------------------------
A standalone probe composed the real registry, tool, event and protocol mapper:
  registry -> tool.run -> emitted AgentEvent -> mapAgentEvent -> ChatEvent[]
written outside the worktree (%TEMP%\d17-e2e-probe.mts, run with
`node --import tsx`), 15/15 checks passed:
