- `npm run build:server`                      -> exit 0 (dist/server.cjs 19.3mb, pdf worker copied)
- `(cd packages/web && npx next build)`       -> exit 0 (compiled successfully, 25/25 static pages)
- `node --import tsx --test src/tools/__tests__/videoStudioState.test.ts src/tools/__tests__/videoStudio.test.ts src/server/__tests__/videoStudioRelay.test.ts src/server/__tests__/videoStudioE2E.test.ts`
  -> tests 71, pass 71, fail 0
- `(cd packages/web && npx vitest run)`      -> 72 files / 472 tests, all pass
- `npm run check:encoding` -> OK (no BOM, no mojibake, all JSON valid)
- `npm run check:eval` / `check:orchestrator` / `check:recovery` / `check:modes` -> exit 0
- `node --import tsx --test "src/**/*.test.ts"` -> tests 2157, pass 2155, fail 2

