## V8: Loam UI Kit / v0 design-system parity

V8 complete: Loam UI Kit / v0 design-system parity - a vetted design-block registry plus the
`ui_examples_search` agent tool, so the model retrieves proven interface blocks (and their
source code) before writing UI by hand.

## What was produced (19 files, all original work; no v0/Vercel prompt text copied)

### 1. Multilingual registry core - `src/design/registry.ts` (+94)
Single source of truth for the design blocks. V8 extended it so Arabic/RTL retrieval works:
- `TAG_RE` now accepts either a Latin kebab tag OR an Arabic word (`[\u0600-\u06FF]+`).
- Added `ARABIC_WORD_RE`; added Arabic stopwords to `STOPWORDS` (e.g. ال, في, من, على).
- New validator rule: every RTL block must carry at least one Arabic tag or the manifest is
  rejected. This keeps RTL blocks discoverable from Arabic queries instead of only by
  directory name.
- New `BlockHit` + `SearchBlockOptions` interfaces; `searchBlocks(query, k, blocksRoot, options)`
  now takes `category` / `rtl` filters.
- Appended `toBlockHit`, `readEntry`, `snippet` so a hit carries the block's own source snippet.

### 2. Retrieval layer - `src/design/retrieval.ts` (new, 143)
A thin, non-duplicating layer over `registry.ts`: `loadDesignRegistry`, `searchDesignBlocks`,
`cosineSimilarity`, `rerankWithEmbeddings`, and the `BlockHit`/`BlockRecord`/`ScoredBlock`/
`DesignEmbedder` types. BM25 scores the registry; `rerankWithEmbeddings` optionally re-ranks
the top-K with a caller-supplied embedder. No scoring logic is duplicated from registry.ts.

### 3. Agent tool - `src/tools/uiExamples.ts` (new, 141)
`ui_examples_search` returns `BlockHit`s: id / name / category / description / tags / intent /
deps / rtl / lang / entry / license / source / code / score. `k` is clamped to 1..10. When a
block has a screenshot it is attached as a base64 image content part.

### 4. Wiring (all in the existing registry, following existing conventions)
- `src/index.ts` - register the tool factory.
- `src/server/runTools.ts` - `ui_examples_search` added to `ALWAYS_ON_TOOLS`.
- `src/agent/prompt.ts` - one-line guidance injected after the `design_lint` check.
- `src/config.ts` - the design blocks directory constant.
- `src/server/__tests__/runTools.test.ts` - the fixture registry now registers the tool so the
  always-on assertion keeps passing (the test was updated, not weakened).

### 5. Block manifests enriched with Arabic tags/intents
All 8 RTL blocks plus `pricing-3-tier` and `pricing-toggle` gained Arabic `tags`/`intent` values
so Arabic and English queries both resolve to the right block.

