   preserved D17 report above; the failing file, taskToolScope.ts and planTools.ts are all
   byte-identical to manus-parity (`git diff manus-parity HEAD -- <file>` is empty).
2. `src/preview/__tests__/shot.test.ts` -> `EADDRINUSE: address already in use 127.0.0.1:4317`.
